      "id": "sol.ahsme-1967-p23.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The difference is \\[ \\log_3\\left(\\frac{6x-5}{2x+1}\\right). \\] The fraction approaches \\(3,\\) so the expression approaches \\(\\log_3 3=1.\\)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is B.",
